=== 6. Build object and link-boundary reminders ===
The Stage28a symbol inventory found controller references satisfied by WCL PCI, Skywalk queue and RX adapter objects, plus airport/RTW88IEEE80211.o.
The Stage28a inventory found InfraInterface references satisfied by airport/RTW88WCLRadioBridge.o and airport/RTW88WCLWorkQueue.o.
The Stage28a inventory found PCI backend references satisfied by airport/RTW88HwOps.o and compat/rtw88_compat.o.
The Stage28a inventory found TX adapter references satisfied by airport/RTW88IEEE80211.o.
A no-obvious-symbol-collision result is not proof that two translation units share a compatible class/vtable ABI.
The native target must not inherit legacy IO80211 class definitions by accident.
LIMIT: this report is source-context evidence; it does not prove runtime ABI safety, complete framework symbol resolution, or functional packet I/O.
